		(at 7.95 25.54 90)
		(descr "TO-220AB three-lead vertical, 2.54mm lead pitch, for Infineon IRLZ44NPBF. KiCad's TO-220-3_Vertical land pattern with 1.40mm drills instead of 1.10mm: the JEDEC TO-220AB rectangular lead envelope of 1.01 x 0.61mm has a 1.18mm diagonal, and a 1.40mm drill keeps a 1.32mm finished hole after the -0.08mm fabrication tolerance. Pin 1 gate, 2 drain, 3 source; the tab is internally the drain. https://www.infineon.com/assets/row/public/documents/24/49/infineon-irlz44n-datasheet-en.pdf")
