		(at 49.25 6.3 180)
		(descr "Fuseholder horizontal open, 5x20mm, 500V, 16A, Schurter 0031.8201 THT. The datasheet drilling diagram specifies exactly two 1.3 +0.1/-0 mm holes at 22.5mm pitch and no central hole: the front view's dia 2.7 feature is part of the moulded body, not a PCB drill. A 1.4mm nominal drill stays inside that 1.30-1.40mm finished window after the -0.08mm fabrication tolerance. Body 25 x 9.6mm with a 10.8mm installation width and 11.5mm uncovered height; leave that height clear so the cartridge lifts out from above. https://us.schurter.com/bundles/snceschurter/epim/_ProdPool_/newDS/en/typ_OGN.pdf")
